 sapere che il ragazzo è diventato uno spacciatore ed è amico di quel Denny che aveva incotrato al suo arrivo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Brother","overview":"A Japanese Yakuza gangster's deadly existence in his homeland gets him exiled to Los Angeles, where he is taken in by his little brother and his brother's gang.","tagline":"Are You Japanese?"},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"BROTHER","overview":"武闘派ヤクザの山本は、その血の気の多さ故に組からも煙たがられるようになった。追われるように弟のケンを頼って舎弟の加藤とアメリカに渡った山本は、デニー達黒色系アメリカ人やメキシカンと手を組み、白人マフィアのボス達を血祭りに上げ、その勢力を拡大していく。しかし、加藤が自らの命と引き替えに白瀬達の日本人マフィアを山本の傘下に収めた頃から崩壊の序曲が始まった。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2WrkJWFgV6S2wjY8LzwiC4u3mER.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cL1VX6WllejQQhGTUGGWHW25yor.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":327,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rSRJozSafFFuiFT9XnwsE1ricHT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rSRJozSafFFuiFT9XnwsE1ricHT.jpg","language":"en","width":1280,"height":1920},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rSRJozSafFFuiFT9XnwsE1ricHT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rSRJozSafFFuiFT9XnwsE1ricHT.jpg","language":"en","width":1280,"height":1920},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h7UKdWriX8keKOgSlBrk4OG7XRL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h7UKdWriX8keKOgSlBrk4OG7XRL.jpg","language":"en","width":850,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/frhzQ5JJ29R3kXuVq3CRYQSczpn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/frhzQ5JJ29R3kXuVq3CRYQSczpn.jpg","language":"en","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hAdKI8q3W2a8h99X0OdrLCEKtqV